  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "クチバ　ジムリーダー　マチスから\nもらった　サインしきし。\nＧｏｏｄ　Ｌｕｃｋ！と　かかれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "갈색체육관 관장 마티스에게\n받은 사인이 적힌 종이.\nGood Luck!이라고 써 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從枯葉市道館館主馬志士\n手上拿到的簽名板。\n上面寫著「Good Luck！」。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "C’est un autographe de Major Bob, le Champion\nde l’Arène de Carmin sur Mer ! Il y a écrit « Good luck ! »\ndessus.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Das ist ein Autogramm von Major Bob,\ndem Arenaleiter von Orania City.\nDarauf steht: „Viel Glück, [VAR (00FF,0806,0000)]RekrutRekrutin!“",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El autógrafo del Teniente Surge, el Líder de Gimnasio\nde Ciudad Carmín. La dedicatoria reza: \"Good luck!\".",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "È l’autografo di Lt. Surge, il Capopalestra\ndi Aranciopoli. C’è scritto “Good luck!”.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The autograph you got from the Vermilion City Gym\nLeader, Lt. Surge. He wrote, “Good luck!”",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "クチバ　ジムリーダー　マチスから\nもらった　サイン色紙。\nＧｏｏｄ　Ｌｕｃｋ！と　書かれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "枯叶市道馆馆主马志士\n给你的彩色签名纸。\n上面写着“Good Luck！”。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El autógrafo del Teniente Surge, el Líder de Gimnasio\nde Ciudad Carmín. La dedicatoria reza: \"Good luck!\".",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
